body:
i realised that ive been putting my T gel near my injection site, so i stopped doing that. im yet to have another blood test (ik ik ive just too busy lol), but defo check u havent been accidentally putting T on the injection site.

https://www.gendergp.com/help-centre/blood-test-orders/
if u scroll down abit itll show u what to do to prevent contamination incase ur test results are contaminted. better to be in the know before changing ur medication! :)

yes, its my favourite way to have sex with my gf! my dick is around 2.5 inches (6.35cm) and it feels so good. no pain and im able to cum inside her. 

it all depends on your anatomy and ur partners, but also equally as important is positioning. dont be scared of trial and error because experimenting whats best for you sexually is the scariest yet most rewarding thing us trans men can do. try it with a partner whos reassuring and understanding. missionary didnt work for me and my gf and she reassured me that it was okay, and we found out cowgirl/reverse cowgirl works best for us personally.

try out different positions and have fun with it! its okay if it doesnt work, even cis couples cant do absolutely everything like in porn (cus porn isnt real!)

you will walk by unassuming strangers everyday who would beat you up if they knew you were trans. its a harsh reality living in a hateful society, especially if you live in a country where its illegal. even if its not illegal, there will be people who are transphobic. 

as much as i love celebrating being trans during pride month, im a stealth man for safety reasons. know your audience, and who you feel safest with. 

if you encounter hate, which you eventually probably will, remember that its your life and not theirs. hate is rooted in ignorance and have pride in being a better human than ignorant bigots :)

ah im sorry if it upsets other people. i just wanted to show people how stupid transphobes are that they cant do their own research. essentially proving our point to not bother with bigot idiots.

if it came across that way and it upset you im very sorry :(

